[=#oraclesid]
= SID / Service Name =

The //sid// option restricts clients to the given SID/SERVICE_NAME, or comma-separated list of them.  Others are refused with ORA-12514.  If unset, any are accepted.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@parts/sqlrelay-oraclefesid.conf@
}}}
